  "note": [
    "The table the Huế Vietnamese number composer is held to.",
    "",
    "Generated from the implementation that has been shipping since 0.152,",
    "so every row is what a learner of this language has actually been",
    "shown. The port is a rewrite of how the words are stored and asked for,",
    "not of what they come out as: nothing below should differ by a character from what 0.152 said.",
    "",
    "Which means this table is not a review waiting to happen, the way the",
    "Palestinian Arabic one is. It is a fence. If a row here ever changes,",
    "somebody has changed what an existing learner sees, and that wants",
    "saying out loud rather than merging."
